  "worked_solution": "We can express the ratio of the amount of sugar to the amount of flour as follows:\n\n$$\n\\text{amount of sugar}:\\text{amount of flour}\n$$\n\nWe compute our ratio as follows:\n\n- First, we count the amount of sugar. There is $1$ cup of sugar.\n\n- Next, we count the amount of flour. There is $1$ cup of flour.\n\nTherefore, the ratio of sugar to flour is $1:1.$",
